scenario: AI-KEYS-01
title: Live provider answer
area: Assistant
rows: F-AI-02
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: You have your own key for one provider (OpenAI, Claude or Gemini). Never type it anywhere but the Settings page that asks for it.
step: Open Settings, Assistants and add your key for the provider.
expect: The key is accepted and is not shown again in clear text.
clause: key
step: Open Chat and ask a short question.
expect: An answer arrives within a few seconds and names no key.
clause: answer
step: Remove the key from Settings.
expect: The assistant says it has no key for that provider and asks you to add one.
clause: remove
